  "notes": "{読|よ}み{込|こ}む is a transitive godan verb that combines {読|よ}む (to read) and {込|こ}む (into, deeply). The {込|こ}む element adds the nuance of thoroughness or inward movement.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{読|よ}み{込|こ}んでいる can mean either \"is currently loading\" (ongoing action for sense 1) or \"has studied thoroughly\" (resulting state for sense 2).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- Xを{読|よ}み{込|こ}む (load X / read X thoroughly)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- データを{読|よ}み{込|こ}む (load data)\n- ファイルを{読|よ}み{込|こ}む (load a file)\n- {台本|だいほん}を{読|よ}み{込|こ}む (study a script)\n\nThe noun form {読|よ}み{込|こ}み is commonly used in computing to mean \"loading\" (e.g., {読|よ}み{込|こ}み{中|ちゅう} = now loading).",
